PRD — Tuto Web Dashboard (UI Foundation & Home Page)

Owner: Tarun
Editors: Cursor
Date: 2025-10-06
Scope (this PRD): Create a modern, unified UI foundation for the web dashboard and implement the Home page using shared design tokens and a small, reusable component kit.
Out of scope: Backend/data wiring, auth, routing beyond Home page

1) Objectives & Success Criteria
Goals

Establish shared design tokens (colors, radii, borders, spacing, shadows, typography) for the web dashboard, aligned with the mobile app’s vibe (no direct cloning of 3rd-party styles).

Build a small UI kit (Card, Button, Input, Table) styled via tokens (no inline Tailwind colors).

Implement a professional Home page with:

Sticky header

Toolbar (search + actions)

KPI cards row

Primary data table (compact density)

Right rail (Quick Actions, Announcements, Shortcuts)

Footer

Success (acceptance)

Visual: Not “empty” or “spacey”; tight density; consistent card + 1px border + pill buttons.

Technical: All surfaces/components use CSS variables from base.css tokens.

UX: Single primary table; secondary info in right rail; modern header & toolbar.

Accessibility: Keyboard focus states; sensible aria labels; contrast >= WCAG AA for text.

2) Non-Goals

No full design system or component library beyond the essentials.

No dark/light mode switch (we’ll use a light-on-white content surface with subtle shadows).

No data integration yet (use placeholder rows).

3) Design Principles

Token-first: All colors/radii/shadows from CSS variables (single source of truth).

Compact by default: Data UIs need density; use .density-compact root class.

Quiet surfaces: White content surfaces + 1px borders + subtle shadows; gradients reserved for CTAs only.

Shape language: Rounded cards, pill buttons, thin borders (professional, not playful).

A11y: Clear focus states and hit targets; no tiny text below 12px on desktop.
4) Folder Structure
/apps/web
  /src
    /app
      /layout.tsx
      /page.tsx              <-- Home page (in scope)
    /components/ui
      Button.tsx
      Card.tsx
      Field.tsx
      Table.tsx
    /styles
      base.css               <-- tokens + utilities (in scope)
  /public
    /fonts/Inter-VariableFont_slnt,wght.ttf
/docs
  PRD-UI-Web-Dashboard.md    <-- this PRD


If you’re using a monorepo with mobile, consider /packages/ui-tokens later to share tokens. For this PRD, keep tokens in base.css.

5) Design Tokens (to be placed in /apps/web/src/styles/base.css)

Replace the color values with your mobile theme equivalents later. For now, this is a clean neutral set. Keep the variable names as-is.

/* ===========================
   Tuto Dashboard — base.css
   =========================== */

/* --- Tokens --- */
:root{
  /* Colors (replace with your mobile palette) */
  --bg: #F5F7FB;               /* page background (very light) */
  --card: #FFFFFF;             /* card surface */
  --text: #1A1D29;             /* main text on white */
  --text-muted: #6C738A;       /* secondary text */
  --primary: #5B6DFA;          /* CTA */
  --primary-alt: #3E4FD8;      /* CTA hover */
  --border: rgba(26,29,41,0.12); /* subtle 1px borders */
  --overlay: rgba(10,12,20,0.6); /* modal scrim */

  /* Radii */
  --radius-xs: 6px;
  --radius-sm: 10px;
  --radius-md: 14px;
  --radius-lg: 20px;
  --radius-pill: 9999px;

  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
  --shadow-lg: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.14);

  /* Spacing scale */
  --space-1: 4px; --space-2: 8px; --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 20px; --space-6: 24px; --space-7: 28px; --space-8: 32px;
}

/* --- Typography & Base --- */
@font-face{
  font-family:"InterVar";
  src:url("/fonts/Inter-VariableFont_slnt,wght.ttf") format("truetype");
  font-weight:100 900; font-display:swap;
}
*{ box-sizing:border-box }
html,body{ height:100% }
body{
  margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
  font-family: InterVar, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans";
  line-height:1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
}

/* Density (apply on page root) */
.density-compact .table thead th,
.density-compact .table tbody td{ padding:8px 10px }

/* --- Layout --- */
.container{ max-width:1120px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 var(--space-6) }

.header{
  position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);
  backdrop-filter:saturate(140%) blur(8px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.toolbar{
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  gap:var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-4) 0;
}

.divider{ height:1px; background:var(--border); margin:var(--space-6) 0 }
.muted{ color:var(--text-muted) }

/* --- Components --- */
.card{
  background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:var(--space-5);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm); transition:box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.card:hover{ box-shadow:var(--shadow-md) }

.btn{
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; cursor:pointer; user-select:none;
  border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-pill);
  padding:10px 14px; background:#fff; color:var(--text); text-decoration:none;
  transition: background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease, transform .06s ease;
}
.btn:active{ transform: translateY(1px) }
.btn:focus-visible{ outline:3px solid color-mix(in oklab,var(--primary) 50%, white); outline-offset:2px }
.btn--primary{ background:var(--primary); color:#fff; border-color:transparent }
.btn--primary:hover{ background:var(--primary-alt) }
.btn--subtle{ background:#fff; color:var(--text) }
.btn--ghost{ background:transparent; border-color:transparent; color:var(--text) }
.btn--ghost:hover{ background:rgba(0,0,0,.03) }

.input{
  width:100%; background:#fff; color:var(--text);
  border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-pill);
  padding:10px 14px; outline:none;
}
.input:focus{ border-color: color-mix(in oklab,var(--primary) 30%, black) }

/* Table */
.table{ border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius-md); overflow:hidden; background:#fff }
.table table{ width:100%; border-collapse:separate; border-spacing:0 }
.table thead th{
  font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.02em; color:var(--text-muted);
  background:#F4F6FA; text-align:left; padding:10px 12px;
}
.table tbody td{ padding:10px 12px; border-top:1px solid var(--border) }
.table tbody tr:hover{ background:#FAFBFF }
6) UI Components (to be created in /apps/web/src/components/ui/)

Button.tsx

import React from "react";

type Props = React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement> & {
  variant?: "primary" | "subtle" | "ghost";
  asChild?: boolean;
};

export function Button({ variant="subtle", className="", children, ...rest }: Props) {
  const base = "btn";
  const map = { primary: "btn--primary", subtle: "btn--subtle", ghost: "btn--ghost" } as const;
  return (
    <button className={`${base} ${map[variant]} ${className}`} {...rest}>
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}


Card.tsx

import React from "react";
export function Card({ children, className="" }: React.PropsWithChildren<{className?:string}>) {
  return <div className={`card ${className}`}>{children}</div>;
}


Field.tsx (input)

import React from "react";
type Props = React.InputHTMLAttributes<HTMLInputElement>;
export function Field(props: Props) {
  return <input className="input" {...props} />;
}


Table.tsx

import React from "react";

export function Table({
  head,
  rows,
}:{
  head: string[];
  rows: (string|number)[][];
}) {
  return (
    <div className="card table">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>{head.map((h,i)=><th key={i}>{h}</th>)}</tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {rows.map((r,ri)=>(
            <tr key={ri}>{r.map((c,ci)=><td key={ci}>{c}</td>)}</tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  );
}

7) Home Page Layout (to implement in /apps/web/src/app/page.tsx)

Requirements

Root has .density-compact.

Header: brand (placeholder), title + subtitle, actions (Help, EN/VI, New Booking).

Toolbar: Search input + 3 buttons (Filters, Export CSV, Invite Teacher).

KPI row: 4 cards with label + prominent value.

Primary table: Teachers list with 6 columns (Teacher, Subject, Bookings, Rating, Fee, Status).

Right rail: Quick Actions (Create Class, Add Student, Assign Homework, Send Message), Announcements, Shortcuts.

Footer: muted, © 2025 Tuto.

Reference Implementation

'use client'
import React from 'react'
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/Button'
import { Card } from '@/components/ui/Card'
import { Field } from '@/components/ui/Field'
import { Table } from '@/components/ui/Table'

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <div className="density-compact">
      {/* Header */}
      <header className="header">
        <div className="container" style={{paddingTop: 12, paddingBottom: 12}}>
          <div style={{display:'flex', alignItems:'center', justifyContent:'space-between', gap:16}}>
            <div style={{display:'flex', alignItems:'center', gap:12}}>
              <div style={{width:40, height:40}} className="card" />
              <div>
                <div style={{fontWeight:800}}>Tuto Dashboard</div>
                <div className="muted" style={{fontSize:12}}>Manage teachers, bookings & reviews</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style={{display:'flex', gap:8}}>
              <Button variant="ghost">Help</Button>
              <Button variant="ghost">EN / VI</Button>
              <Button variant="primary">New Booking</Button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      {/* Toolbar */}
      <div className="container toolbar">
        <div style={{flex:1}}>
          <Field placeholder="Search teachers, bookings, students…" aria-label="Search" />
        </div>
        <div style={{display:'flex', gap:8}}>
          <Button>Filters</Button>
          <Button>Export CSV</Button>
          <Button>Invite Teacher</Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Content grid */}
      <main className="container" style={{display:'grid', gridTemplateColumns:'2fr 1fr', gap:20}}>
        {/* Left column */}
        <section>
          {/* KPIs */}
          <div style={{display:'grid', gridTemplateColumns:'repeat(4,1fr)', gap:12, marginBottom:16}}>
            <Card><div className="muted" style={{fontSize:12}}>Bookings</div><div style={{fontWeight:800, fontSize:20}}>128</div></Card>
            <Card><div className="muted" style={{fontSize:12}}>Active Teachers</div><div style={{fontWeight:800, fontSize:20}}>42</div></Card>
            <Card><div className="muted" style={{fontSize:12}}>Avg. Rating</div><div style={{fontWeight:800, fontSize:20}}>4.7</div></Card>
            <Card><div className="muted" style={{fontSize:12}}>Open Issues</div><div style={{fontWeight:800, fontSize:20}}>5</div></Card>
          </div>

          {/* Primary table */}
          <Table
            head={["Teacher","Subject","Bookings","Rating","Fee","Status"]}
            rows={[
              ["Nguyen A","Math",12,4.8,"350k","Active"],
              ["Le B","English",9,4.6,"400k","Active"],
              ["Tran C","Physics",7,4.5,"420k","Trial"],
            ]}
          />
        </section>

        {/* Right rail */}
        <aside style={{display:'grid', gap:16}}>
          <Card>
            <div style={{fontWeight:700, marginBottom:8}}>Quick Actions</div>
            <div style={{display:'flex', flexWrap:'wrap', gap:8}}>
              <Button>Create Class</Button>
              <Button>Add Student</Button>
              <Button>Assign Homework</Button>
              <Button>Send Message</Button>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card>
            <div style={{fontWeight:700, marginBottom:8}}>Announcements</div>
            <div className="muted" style={{fontSize:14}}>Teacher onboarding webinar on Friday 15:00</div>
          </Card>

          <Card>
            <div style={{fontWeight:700, marginBottom:8}}>Shortcuts</div>
            <div style={{display:'grid', gap:8}}>
              <a className="btn" href="#">Teacher Profiles</a>
              <a className="btn" href="#">Bookings Calendar</a>
              <a className="btn" href="#">Reports</a>
              <a className="btn" href="#">Settings</a>
            </div>
          </Card>
        </aside>
      </main>

      <div className="container divider"></div>
      <footer className="container muted" style={{paddingBottom:24}}>© 2025 Tuto</footer>
    </div>
  )
}

8) Accessibility Requirements

All interactive elements have visible focus styles (:focus-visible already defined on .btn).

Provide aria-label for the search Field.

Table headers use <th> and are text-only (no bare icons without text).

Minimum text sizes: body ≥ 14px, labels ≥ 12px.

9) Performance & Technical Constraints

No CSS frameworks for this task; do not import external CSS libs.

No Tailwind utility colors; all colors/radii/shadows from base.css.

Keep CSS small and component-agnostic; avoid per-page bespoke styles.

Fonts: use local variable Inter in /public/fonts/ as defined.

