Company blurb block (left of columns on wide screens):

Tuto logo (non-stretched; height: 28–36px; width:auto)

Short mission line (i18n string)

Registered entity info (optional placeholders)

Social icons row: Facebook, Instagram, X, YouTube, TikTok (link to placeholders)

3) UX & Design Requirements

Structure: One top footer band with columns + social block. A thin top border (var(--border)), background a light neutral (use #F4F6FA or derive from tokens); text uses --text and --text-muted.

Typography: Section titles 13–14px, semi-bold; links 14–15px; muted microcopy 12–13px.

Spacing: Column gap ≥ 40px; list item vertical spacing 8–10px; outer padding var(--space-6) ~ var(--space-8).

Icons: Use a single icon set (e.g., SVG inline). Focus ring uses existing .btn:focus-visible style.

Logo: Never stretched; respect aspect ratio.

4) Technical Requirements

Tokens only: colors, radii, shadows from base.css. No inline hex values in JSX.

i18n: Use existing provider if present (I18nProvider). If absent, create minimal local dictionaries for en and vi within the footer component folder (temporary).

Accessibility:

<nav aria-label="Footer"> wrapping the columns.

Each column inside <section aria-labelledby="footer-<key>"> with <h3 id="footer-<key>">.

Links are <a> with descriptive labels, keyboard-focusable, visible focus state.

Responsive:

≥1200px: 1 social block + 6 columns (7 total zones).

768–1199px: social block full width first, then columns in 2–3 per row.

≤767px: stacked sections with collapsible accordions optional (non-blocking for this PRD).

